  m_Name: Note_Audio_BeamRotation1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  id: AudioLog_BeamRotation1
  title: Rotational Mechanism Adjustment
  key: 14
  boardContentText: The rotation mechanism can be manually adjusted
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  lockedPlaceholder: -???????
  boardUpdates: []
  contentText: "It's such a strange feeling. After all these years.\nI thought nothing
    would ever change. That life would just be... endlessly the same. On and on.
    Day after day, slowly crawling, from nowhere to nowhere. And me along with it.\nAnd
    then today I found that mechanism under the lighthouse. Levers, a diagram, instructions.
    So I played with it \u2014 that's not like me, but somehow I couldn't stop. Somehow
    I couldn't make sense of what I was doing.\n(pause)\nYou know how it is, when
    someone spends their whole life in a flat with the furniture always arranged
    the same way. Over and over. And then one day they come home \u2014 and everything
    is different. First, shock. Confusion. How is this even possible?\nLeft lever
    up. The rest down.\nAnd the water level dropped.\n(silence)\nHow is that even
    possible? Or... or am I losing my mind? Eight years here alone, things can happen
    to a person's head.\nBut I went to look. Three times. And every time \u2014 the
    water. Lower.\n(slowly)\nMaybe something is still waiting for me. Something I
    didn't expect. After all this time.\nThat would be a first. In a very long while."
  paperSprite: {fileID: 0}
